WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.805
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Public Speaking!

2
00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:07.188
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:07.488 --> 00:00:09.453
Today's topic is At the Zoo.

4
00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:16.318
Today we practise speaking in front of friends. Stand tall, smile, and use a big voice.

5
00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:18.190
Penguin!

6
00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:20.988
Penguin. Your turn!

7
00:00:23.888 --> 00:00:24.761
Penguin!

8
00:00:25.061 --> 00:00:25.981
Great!

9
00:00:26.983 --> 00:00:28.159
Kangaroo!

10
00:00:29.059 --> 00:00:31.142
Kangaroo. Your turn!

11
00:00:34.042 --> 00:00:35.206
Kangaroo!

12
00:00:35.506 --> 00:00:36.588
Wonderful!

13
00:00:37.583 --> 00:00:38.317
Hippo!

14
00:00:39.217 --> 00:00:41.452
Hippo. Your turn!

15
00:00:44.352 --> 00:00:45.399
Hippo!

16
00:00:45.699 --> 00:00:46.724
Super!

17
00:00:47.717 --> 00:00:48.578
Panda!

18
00:00:49.478 --> 00:00:51.573
Panda. Your turn!

19
00:00:54.473 --> 00:00:55.440
Panda!

20
00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:56.706
Excellent!

21
00:00:57.717 --> 00:01:04.365
Tip one: look at your friends. Tip two: speak slowly. Tip three: smile!

22
00:01:04.665 --> 00:01:06.235
I can do it!

23
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:17.761
Hello, everyone! My name is Malis. Today I talk about At the Zoo. The kangaroo can hop. The penguin can swim. Thank you!

24
00:01:18.061 --> 00:01:19.515
Wonderful speech!

25
00:01:20.517 --> 00:01:26.713
Now you speak. Say hello, say your name, then say: The kangaroo can hop. The penguin can swim.

26
00:01:35.013 --> 00:01:36.652
Clap, clap, clap!

27
00:01:36.952 --> 00:01:39.465
Brave and bright! Well done!

28
00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:45.822
Great job today, everyone! See you next time. Bye-bye!

29
00:01:46.122 --> 00:01:47.343
Bye-bye!

